Package: uv
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: extremely fast Python package and project manager
 uv installs Python versions and packages and manages per-project virtual
 environments. SOS uses it so that every project owns its CUDA/PyTorch
 stack while the OS owns only the driver.
 .
 Repackaged by SOS from the official, checksum-verified release binaries.
